#: ../../source/docs/common-echologger-ect400.rst:5
#: 9d147345d6e74c9894f5ab67e79678e9
msgid "Echologger ECT400 echosounder"
msgstr "Echologger ECT400 测深仪"

#: ../../source/docs/common-echologger-ect400.rst:7
#: d22c1efc2c3c4719903ba7f0e73cdb15
msgid ""
"The `EchoLogger ECT400 <http://www.echologger.com/products/9>`__ is an "
"echosounder (aka underwater sonar) with a 100m range, 5 degree beam width "
"and 1hz ~ 10hz update rate. More details can be found in the `datasheet "
"<http://www.echologger.com/media/main/product/6a5d0079-6a03-469d-b94a-fa0854e4f510.pdf>`__"
msgstr ""
"`EchoLogger ECT400 <http://www.echologger.com/products/9>`__ "
"是一款测深仪（即水下声呐），量程 100m，波束宽度 5 度，更新频率 1Hz ~ 10Hz。更多详情请参见 `数据手册 "
"<http://www.echologger.com/media/main/product/6a5d0079-6a03-469d-b94a-fa0854e4f510.pdf>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-echologger-ect400.rst:12
#: fc19d641fea84ab0a4b3771e83754cc4
msgid "*image courtesy of echologger.com*"
msgstr "*图片由 echologger.com 提供*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-echologger-ect400.rst:16
#: 9b5dc71559ed41b09847b1fcc3fa651e
msgid "Support for this sensor was added to Rover-3.4."
msgstr "对该传感器的支持已加入 Rover-3.4。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-echologger-ect400.rst:19
#: 343f1597c5e04602afa19d07694ebab9
msgid "Recommended Hardware"
msgstr "推荐硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-echologger-ect400.rst:21
#: f903000284004873a93903f2ab8ea5f4
msgid ""
"ECT400 can be purchased after `emailing echologger.com "
"<http://echologger.com/contact>`__"
msgstr ""
"ECT400 可通过 `发邮件给 echologger.com <http://echologger.com/contact>`__ 后购买"

#: ../../source/docs/common-echologger-ect400.rst:22
#: a7df12f3003d4921a901a0fc487f0813
msgid ""
"`Sparkfun RS232 To Serial converter "
"<https://www.sparkfun.com/products/8780>`__"
msgstr "`Sparkfun RS232 转串口转换器 <https://www.sparkfun.com/products/8780>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-echologger-ect400.rst:23
#: b167830d0a5e4254a2a6b672f3a2678b
msgid ""
"`USB to RS232 converter <https://www.sparkfun.com/products/11304>`__ to "
"allow testing and configuring the sensor with a PC"
msgstr ""
"`USB 转 RS232 转换器 <https://www.sparkfun.com/products/11304>`__，用于在 PC "
"上测试和配置传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-echologger-ect400.rst:26
#: 871c28b32bc94433a15de1eae54abef6
msgid "Connecting and Configuring"
msgstr "连接与配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-echologger-ect400.rst:28
#: 6d65e789432d431094d3f9be92baff00
msgid ""
"The ECT400 provides distance measurements using the NMEA protocol over "
"serial at 115200 baud."
msgstr "ECT400 通过串口以 NMEA 协议、115200 波特率提供距离测量数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-echologger-ect400.rst:30
#: 196abfd7d07d4050be5082f159504429
msgid ""
"The sensor can be connected to any available serial/uart port on the "
"autopilot.  In the diagram below the first sensor is connected to SERIAL2."
msgstr "该传感器可连接到飞控上任意可用的串口/UART 接口。在下方示意图中，第一个传感器连接到 SERIAL2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-echologger-ect400.rst:35
#: c093d78421924b2985a1fec9f6791313
msgid "If the SERIAL2 is used then the following parameters should be set:"
msgstr "若使用 SERIAL2，则应设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-echologger-ect400.rst:37
#: 532241fce91d4ecb875a4ac237bcea19
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9 (Lidar)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9 (Lidar)"

#: ../../source/docs/common-echologger-ect400.rst:38
#: c48b95fcaf6e4fb099be54b784268e0d
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115 (115200 baud)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115 (115200 baud)"

#: ../../source/docs/common-echologger-ect400.rst:40
#: 7d6dbe6824d2416dba2e3f1501e2e87c
msgid "Then the following range finder related parameters should be set:"
msgstr "然后设置以下测距仪相关参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-echologger-ect400.rst:42
#: a5ff03dc68544c158b0c586ba7e7c302
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 17 (NMEA)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 17 (NMEA)"

#: ../../source/docs/common-echologger-ect400.rst:43
#: 2df65aeeea7a4d1ca7796b7c699b44db
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.13"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.13"

#: ../../source/docs/common-echologger-ect400.rst:44
#: 0ae1cb9dd7ee4a47bc2835363e25f955
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 100 (i.e. 100m).  *This is the distance "
"in meters that the rangefinder can reliably read.*"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 100（即 100m）。*这是测距仪可靠读取的最大距离，单位为米。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-echologger-ect400.rst:45
#: bf80ccb877d444d883a9418d39b54b40
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT <RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = 25 (i.e. down) if mounted on a boat"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT <RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = 25（即向下），如果安装在船上"

#: ../../source/docs/common-echologger-ect400.rst:48
#: 68403a1deb184f05b19168651f6170d4
msgid "Configuring the sensor"
msgstr "配置传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-echologger-ect400.rst:50
#: 567c2286a0654f3fab05b7bc8867029a
msgid ""
"By default the sensor comes configured to sample the depth at only 1hz and "
"to a maximum depth of 10m."
msgstr "传感器出厂时默认配置为仅以 1Hz 频率采样深度，最大深度 10m。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-echologger-ect400.rst:52
#: 10dd410b72e74a06ab964f4aea8500d6
msgid ""
"Using a `USB to RS232 converter <https://www.sparkfun.com/products/11304>`__"
" connect to the sensor from your PC using a terminal program like `Putty "
"<https://www.putty.org/>`__ (Connection type of \"Serial\", Speed of "
"\"115200\" and Serial line of the appropriate COM port)."
msgstr ""
"使用 `USB 转 RS232 转换器 <https://www.sparkfun.com/products/11304>`__ 从 PC 通过 "
"`Putty <https://www.putty.org/>`__ "
"等终端程序连接到传感器（连接类型选「Serial」，速度设为「115200」，串口选择对应的 COM 端口）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-echologger-ect400.rst:54
#: c50fe85d33374341ba85b3ac62b19cb0
msgid "If connected properly NMEA data should appear on the console.  Type:"
msgstr "连接正常后，控制台应出现 NMEA 数据。输入："

#: ../../source/docs/common-echologger-ect400.rst:69
#: 23ba8d9a1a974f81b80c35c157e09ec3
msgid ""
"More info on NMEA message contents can be found `here "
"<http://www.catb.org/gpsd/NMEA.html>`__"
msgstr "有关 NMEA 消息内容的更多信息，请参见 `此处 <http://www.catb.org/gpsd/NMEA.html>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-echologger-ect400.rst:72
#: 5e15e1655de74df4ad66a9ac20cf423c
msgid "Testing the sensor"
msgstr "测试传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-echologger-ect400.rst:74
#: a080232091064206b9f1a8b3f2ebc606
msgid ""
"Distances read by the sensor can be seen in the Mission Planner's Flight "
"Data screen's Status tab. Look closely for \"rangefinder1\"."
msgstr "传感器读取的距离数据可在 Mission Planner 飞行数据页面的状态选项卡中查看。请仔细查找「rangefinder1」。"
